msgstr "ODT"

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "OpenDocument text: a CV or a letter downloaded as an .odt file, and the text of an .odt you upload kept so that a search can find it. Switched off, the download is not offered and an uploaded file's text is not read."
msgstr "OpenDocument tekst: CV ili pismo preuzeto kao .odt datoteka, i tekst .odt datoteke koju otpremite, sačuvan da ga pretraga može pronaći. Kad je isključeno, preuzimanje se ne nudi i tekst otpremljene datoteke se ne čita."

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "PDF"
msgstr "PDF"

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "The companies' places as a GeoJSON file, out, and points read in that place a company's address by hand once you have ticked them. It needs Maps. Switched off, neither is offered and their addresses answer as if there were nothing there."
msgstr "Mjesta kompanija kao GeoJSON datoteka, za izvoz, i učitane tačke koje, kada ih označite, ručno postavljaju adresu kompanije. Potreban je dodatak Mape. Kada je isključeno, ni jedno ni drugo se ne nudi, a njihove adrese odgovaraju kao da tamo nema ničega."

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "The file formats Postulo can read and write besides its own: PDF, Word, OpenDocument, iCalendar, vCard and Europass. This is the switch for all of them at once; each can still be switched off on its own while this is on, and PDF cannot be. Switched off, nothing is offered in those formats and nothing is deleted: the files you have, and the data they were made from, stay."
msgstr "Formati datoteka koje Postulo može čitati i pisati pored svog vlastitog: PDF, Word, OpenDocument, iCalendar, vCard i Europass. Ovo je prekidač za sve njih odjednom; dok je uključen, svaki se i dalje može isključiti zasebno, osim PDF-a. Kad je isključen, ništa se ne nudi u tim formatima i ništa se ne briše: datoteke koje imate i podaci iz kojih su napravljene ostaju."

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "The format a CV and a letter are made in: tagged, so a screen reader can read it. Always on; Postulo has nothing else that would still be a CV."
msgstr "Format u kojem se prave CV i pismo: s oznakama strukture, tako da ga čitač ekrana može pročitati. Uvijek uključeno; Postulo nema ništa drugo što bi i dalje bio CV."

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "The publications of Your career as a bibliography file, out, and a bibliography file read in: BibTeX, BibLaTeX, RIS and CSL JSON, which Zotero, Mendeley, JabRef, EndNote and LaTeX read and write. What a file holds is listed before anything is added. Switched off, neither is offered and their addresses answer as if there were nothing there."
msgstr ""

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "vCard"
msgstr "vCard"

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "Word documents: a CV or a letter downloaded as a .docx file, and the text of a .docx you upload kept so that a search can find it. Switched off, the download is not offered and an uploaded file's text is not read."
msgstr "Word dokumenti: CV ili pismo preuzeto kao .docx datoteka, i tekst .docx datoteke koju otpremite, sačuvan da ga pretraga može pronaći. Kad je isključeno, preuzimanje se ne nudi i tekst otpremljene datoteke se ne čita."

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "Your calendar as .ics files and feeds, and a calendar file read in. Switched off, the downloads, the import and the feeds are not offered and their addresses answer as if there were nothing there; they answer again, at the same address, when it is switched on."
msgstr "Vaš kalendar kao .ics datoteke i feedovi, te učitavanje datoteke kalendara. Kad je isključeno, preuzimanja, uvoz i feedovi se ne nude, a njihove adrese odgovaraju kao da tamo nema ničega; ponovo odgovaraju, na istoj adresi, kad se uključi."
